msgid "Mail is downloading. You can close this window."
msgstr "E-Mails werden heruntergeladen. Sie können dieses Fenster schließen."

#: app/src/add_account.rs:1405 app/src/add_account.rs:1434
msgid "Your mail is here."
msgstr "Ihre E-Mails sind da."

#: app/src/add_account.rs:1419
msgid ""
"Your organization did not allow one of the permissions Penguin Mail asked "
"for, so this feature stays off:"
msgid_plural ""
"Your organization did not allow {count} of the permissions Penguin Mail "
